                               2
                              w  + 1
   (5)  --------------------------------------------------
                              +--------------------------+
                              |        4       2
          4      3            |     4 w  + 24 w  + 4
        (w  + 2 w  - 2 w - 1) |--------------------------
                              | 4      3      2
                             \|w  + 4 w  + 6 w  + 4 w + 1
                                                    Type: Expression(Integer)
kw := kernels(fa).2
 

   (6)  w
                                            Type: Kernel(Expression(Integer))
ky := kernels(fa).1
 

         +--------------------------+
         |        4       2
         |     4 w  + 24 w  + 4
   (7)   |--------------------------
         | 4      3      2
        \|w  + 4 w  + 6 w  + 4 w + 1
                                            Type: Kernel(Expression(Integer))
